! voltage regulator definitions

! Define three banks of single-phase regulators; each phase is controlled separately

! The regulating transformer is defined as a low-impedance, low-loss 2-winding, 1:1, Y-Y transformer to approximate an ideal regulator
! The control regulates winding 2

